        "original_id": "b576ec60-b174-53e6-887b-34ad8d45aca2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: The von Trapps, Werner von Trapp, Georg Ritter von Trapp, Agathe Whitehead, Maria von Trapp, Kara Tointon\n- Works: The Sound of Music, The Story of the Trapp Family Singers, The Sound of Music Live (2015), Rodgers and Hammerstein's Broadway musical The Sound of Music\n- Places: 3 Mills Studios, London\n\nFacts:\n- Maria von Trapp wrote The Story of the Trapp Family Singers, which was published in 1949.\n- Werner von Trapp was portrayed as Kurt in The Sound of Music.\n- The von Trapps are the grandchildren of Werner von Trapp.\n- The von Trapps are the great-grandchildren of Georg Ritter von Trapp and his first wife Agathe Whitehead.\n- The von Trapps are the step-great-grandchildren of Maria von Trapp, Georg Ritter von Trapp's second wife.\n- The Sound of Music Live (2015) was an adaptation of Rodgers and Hammerstein's Broadway musical The Sound of Music.\n- The Sound of Music Live (2015) starred Kara Tointon as Maria von Trapp.\n- The Sound of Music Live (2015) was performed and televised live from 3 Mills Studios in London.",
